#: docs/guides/building.md
msgid "Deploy the [example products]{1} and run their conformance steps. Document review exercises the pipeline, review and release capabilities; the annual census exercises master data, collection, indicators and publication. Between them they reach most of the platform."
msgstr ""

#: docs/guides/building.md
msgid "**Done when** the conformance steps of both products pass and their evidence is in the binding."
msgstr ""

#: docs/guides/building.md
msgid "5. Keep it conforming"
msgstr ""

#: docs/guides/building.md
msgid "Scheduled fitness functions keep checking what was proved once ([CAP-GUARDRAILS.2]{1})."
msgstr ""

#: docs/guides/building.md
msgid "When the blueprint's version changes, read its changelog, update the binding's `blueprint.version`, and set the status of every new or changed clause."
msgstr ""

#: docs/guides/building.md
msgid "Re-check component licences at each upgrade."
msgstr ""

#: docs/guides/building.md
msgid "**Done when** the binding validates against the current catalogue and no fitness function is failing."
msgstr ""

